!/artifacts/runs/1507/
!/artifacts/runs/1507/**
/artifacts/runs/1507/**/annotated/**
/artifacts/runs/1507/**/samples.jsonl
/artifacts/runs/1507/**/samples_chit_gated.jsonl
/artifacts/runs/1507/**/evidence_records.jsonl

